  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skilling Women Farmers in India to Earn an Income</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women in Rural India earn their income from tending to their farmlands or taking care of their farm animals. Over the past 5 years, we have been facing droughts, unseasonal rainfall and increasing temperatures. Ashwini is a women farmer who spent more than INR 25,000 on her farm land but she is afraid of being able to make even INR 5000 back after selling her produce. There is a dire need to train women on scientific ways of farming to build climate resilience and ensure they earn higher incomes</narrative>
  </description>
